# Security headers for all responses (Cloudflare Pages).
# NOTE: a strict Content-Security-Policy is intentionally NOT set here yet — it must be
# tested against Firebase, Flutterwave, Mux/Stream, and Google Fonts origins before
# enabling, or it will break the app. Tracked as a follow-up in the security wave.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
